      "username": "netmanthan",
      "name": "Jawahar Ramkripal Mallah",
      "created_at": "2023-09-18T14:30:21.153Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Regarding POS Awesome and ERPNext 15:</p>\n<p>\"Will POS Awesome be compatible with ERPNext 15?</p>\n<p>I’m curious if the latest version of ERPNext will work seamlessly with POS Awesome, and if there are any specific updates or configurations needed to ensure compatibility.</p>\n<p>Has anyone in the community successfully used POS Awesome with ERPNext 15?</p>\n<p>If so, can you share your experience and any tips for a smooth integration?\"</p>",
