      "id": 376597,
      "username": "NCP",
      "name": "Nihantra Patel",
      "created_at": "2023-09-18T15:22:43.351Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/netmanthan\">@netmanthan</a>,</p>\n<p>First thing, ERPNext version 15 has not launched yet so if you want to check the app then install erpnext in the develop branch and also pos-awesome in the develop branch and then check it.</p>\n<p>More details for contact <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/youssef\">@youssef</a></p>\n<p>Thank You!</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/ncp/{size}/66573_2.png",
