      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Gembira_IT_Tech\" data-post=\"13\" data-topic=\"110087\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/gembira_it_tech/48/65744_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Gembira_IT_Tech:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>But I really hope that one day this will also be available to non-Frappe cloud users.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I don’t think this will ever happen as POS-Awesome is now a pay-to-use app in frappe cloud. This gives me chills as it is an indication of where Frappe is going even though it isn’t obvious yet and there’s no open admittance that Frappe is slowly transitioning…</p>",
